# Incremental-rebuild behavior, one dependency type per test, the
# shapes LLVM's CMake build and Linux's Kbuild express (see the
# dependency taxonomy): generator chains, option flips, source-list
# toggles, subproject relinks, exported flags, vendored dep reports.
# A mutation, a plain make, and assertions on what did and did not
# rebuild.  The shapes that hit gaps in today's pconfigure (bootstrap-
# tool rebuilds and the GENERATE --deps snapshot) arrive with their
# per-gap fix PRs, each landing with the fix that makes it pass.
